split_lang
==========

This crate is a Rust translation of split-lang 2.1.1
(https://github.com/DoodleBears/split-lang), Copyright (c) 2024 DoodleBear,
licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

It also contains a Rust translation of code from the following project.

BudouX (Apache License 2.0)
---------------------------

src/budoux.rs is translated to Rust from `budoux/parser.py` of BudouX 0.10.2
(https://github.com/google/budoux). data/budoux/ja.json and
data/budoux/zh-hans.json are verbatim copies of the models shipped in
`budoux/models/` of the same release.

Copyright 2021 Google LLC

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

Changes: `Parser.__init__`, `Parser.parse`, `load_default_japanese_parser`
and `load_default_simplified_chinese_parser` were translated to Rust. The
default parsers are loaded once and shared. The HTML processing
(`translate_html_string`, `html_processor.py`), the Thai and Traditional
Chinese loaders and the training scripts were not translated.
